OL,3,GNEWSAUpgraded West Highland Line
OL,4,Areopens with #9m Kyle project to follow
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe West Highland Line has been
OL,7,Freopened following the completion of a
OL,8,Fnine-day #13m upgrade.
OL,10,FThe scenic railway line, linking
OL,11,FGlasgow to destinations including Oban
OL,12,Fand Mallaig, features the famous
OL,13,FGlenfinnan Viaduct seen in the Harry
OL,14,FPotter films.
OL,16,FNetwork Rail carried out work at
OL,17,Flocations between Helensburgh, Fort
OL,18,FWilliam and Mallaig.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
