OL,3,GNEWSAUpgraded West Highland Line
OL,4,Areopens with #9m Kyle project to follow
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is now preparing for a #9m project
OL,7,Fat Inverness station and along the Kyle
OL,8,Fline, with services between Inverness,
OL,9,FDingwall and Kyle of Lochalsh affected
OL,10,Ffor three weeks from 28 November.
